        "bodyHtml": "Camille briefly becomes Untargetable and leaps onto an enemy champion, interrupting channels and locking them into an area they cannot escape by any means for 2.5/3.25/4 seconds. Other nearby enemies are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Away</span>. Her Attacks against the trapped enemy deal an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">4/6/8% current Health magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability ends if Camille leaves the area.</span>",
